''[[Avengers Assemble (TV series)|Avengers Assemble]]'' is an animated [[television series]] based on the comic book super hero team known as the [[Avengers (comics)|Avengers]]. It premiered on [[Disney XD]] on May 26, 2013.

{{Aired episodes|2019|2|24|showpage=Avengers Assemble (TV series)}}

On June 1, 2015, the series was renewed for a third season titled ''Avengers: Ultron Revolution'', which premiered on Disney XD on March 13, 2016.<ref name=tvi>{{cite news|last1=Sands|first1=Rich|title=Disney XD Renews (and Retitles) Marvel's Avengers and Ultimate Spider-Man Animated Series|url=http://www.tvinsider.com/article/1986/disney-xd-renews-and-renames-marvel-animated-series-avengers-ultimate-spider-man/|access-date=June 2, 2015|work=TV Insider|date=June 1, 2015}}</ref> It was renewed for a fourth season which is entitled ''Avengers: Secret Wars'', and then a fifth and final season entitled ''Avengers: Black Panther's Quest''.<ref name="cbr.com">{{cite web|url=http://www.cbr.com/avengers-assemble-retitled-black-panther-quest/|title=Avengers Assemble S5 Retitled Avengers: Black Panther Quest|date=22 July 2017}}</ref>

