===Season 2 (2014–15)===
On July 26, 2014, the series was renewed for a second season;<ref name="variety.com">{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2014/tv/news/disney-xd-renews-avengers-hulk-marvel-cartoons-1201269592/|title=Disney XD Renews Marvel's 'Avengers Assemble,' 'Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H.'|first=Maane|last=Khatchatourian|date=26 July 2014}}</ref> The first half of the second season deals with the team facing [[Thanos]], as he competes with them to obtain the [[Infinity Gems]], followed by a five-episode arc detailing the return of [[Ultron]], who plans to exterminate the human race. The rest of the season details the debut of the [[Squadron Supreme]] and their confrontation with the Avengers. The last two episodes detail the escape of Thanos by the Black Order and their attack on Earth.

