===Season 3: ''Ultron Revolution'' (2016–17)===
Ultron returns after his apparent demise and seeks revenge on the Avengers. The Avengers must defeat him as well as new threats like [[Baron Zemo]]'s [[Masters of Evil]] and [[Kang the Conqueror]]. [[Vision (Marvel Comics)|Vision]], [[Black Panther (character)|Black Panther]], [[Carol Danvers|Captain Marvel]], and [[Kamala Khan|Ms. Marvel]] make appearances in this season. The storyline features an adaptation of the ''[[Civil War (comics)|Civil War]]'' comics storyline.<ref name=tvi/> Season three premiered on [[Disney XD]] on March 13, 2016.

